{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONFRONT \u2013 Face Your Fears</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned building. Nothing but silence... and something watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront is a first-person psychological survival horror game that pulls you into a haunting nightmare. In this forsaken place dominated by loneliness and paranoia, the line between reality and illusion begins to blur as your sanity slowly fades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere and immersive environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system with hallucinations that intensify over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive environments and cryptic clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices may keep you alive... or not</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True horror comes from within.</strong><br>If you're ready, don\u2019t close your eyes \u2014 you may never know what\u2019s real again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851330?t=1760391714","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851330?t=1760391714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851330/39eafd4b6fba776e1ea93ffda77142c61056da4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760391714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851330/39eafd4b6fba776e1ea93ffda77142c61056da4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760391714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is only blood and suicide symbolism (hanged man) in the game. There is nothing in the game that encourages or symbolizes violence, sex, alcohol and drugs."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONFRONT \u2013